<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips director Jan Tollenaar to retire.</title>
<headline>Philips director Jan Tollenaar to retire.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Wednesday that Jan Tollenaar intended to retire as executive vice president and member of the board on July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The decision to retire is based on the personal considerations of Mr. Tollenaar,&quot; Philips said.  </p>
<p>Philips said during the coming months, Tollenaar would work toward a smooth transfer of his responsibilities to vice-chairman Dudley Eustace and executive vice president Henk Bodt.</p>
<p>Jan Tollenaar joined Philips in 1962.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
